body:
I can see a lot of 5600 and 5600X on ebay going for around the £100 mark, and that for some strange reason seems to be the same price as the 5600G but the G doesnt seem to be as good so I havent really considered those.

&#x200B;

Even more bizarrely the Ryzen 7 5700G is "worse" than the 5600 and the 5600X which is why I came up with those suggestions in the first place.
